<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc238560406" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 3: Cross reference inside a list item in a workflow</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d347e7">
         <p>Consider a list of related topics where each item contains a link.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Cross reference is inside a list item (workflow)</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry> .md input </entry>
                     <entry> DITA output </entry>
                  </row>                  
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>#Alarm
  - [Alarm Notifier](alarm-notifier.md)
  - [Alarm Types](alarm-types.md)
  - [Alarm Management](alarm-management.md)</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>&lt;concept id="alarm"&gt;
                           &lt;title&gt;Alarm&lt;/title&gt;
                           &lt;conbody&gt;
                           &lt;ul&gt;
                           &lt;li&gt;
                           &lt;xref href="alarm-notifier.dita"&gt;
                           Alarm Notifier
                           &lt;/xref&gt;
                           &lt;/li&gt;
                           &lt;li&gt;
                           &lt;xref href="alarm-types.dita"&gt;
                           Alarm Types
                           &lt;/xref&gt;
                           &lt;/li&gt;
                           &lt;li&gt;
                           &lt;xref href="alarm-management.dita"&gt;
                           Alarm Management
                           &lt;/xref&gt;
                           &lt;/li&gt;
                           &lt;/ul&gt;
                           &lt;/conbody&gt;
                           &lt;/concept&gt;
                        </codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result:</b>The converter preserves the list structure while converting each Markdown link into a DITA cross-reference.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
